n":"1","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-source-to-pay-01-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-source-to-pay-01","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"need","lines":["Twelve learners each need one electronics kit.","The workshop starts 14 October. Kits must arrive by 12 October."],"title":"Workshop brief"},{"id":"offer","lines":["Supplier Birch offers ten camera cases arriving 16 October.","An offer is evidence to compare, not the requirement itself."],"title":"Unsolicited offer"}],"revision":"3","role":"Requester","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa glossary — Source to pay","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/coupa-glossary/overview/s"}],"success":"Requirement saved: 12 electronics kits, needed by 12 October.","title":"Write the requirement"},{"brief":"Select an offer against the declared need and budget. These fictional suppliers are collaborators, not enemies.","campaignId":"coupa-source-to-pay","fields":[{"expected":"Birch","explanation":"Cedar omits the required cases; Maple arrives after the deadline. Birch supplies the complete scope on time within 600 credits.","id":"supplier","label":"Selected offer","options":[{"label":"Birch","value":"Birch"},{"label":"Cedar","value":"Cedar"},{"label":"Maple","value":"Maple"}]},{"expected":"Meets scope, date and budget","explanation":"Choosing the lowest displayed price would omit required cases. Record scope, date and budget so the next owner can understand the award.","id":"basis","label":"Recorded decision basis","options":[{"label":"Meets scope, date and budget","value":"Meets scope, date and budget"},{"label":"Lowest displayed price","value":"Lowest displayed price"}]}],"fixtureRevision":"1","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-source-to-pay-02-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-source-to-pay-02","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"requirement","lines":["12 electronics kits by 12 October. Maximum total: 600 credits.","All kits must include a reusable case."],"title":"Approved requirement"},{"id":"offers","lines":["Birch: 12 kits with cases, 570 credits, 11 October.","Cedar: 12 kits without cases, 510 credits, 10 October.","Maple: 12 kits with cases, 540 credits, 15 October."],"title":"Comparable offers"}],"revision":"3","role":"Buyer","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa glossary — Source to pay","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/coupa-glossary/overview/s"}],"success":"Birch offer linked to the requirement with its decision basis.","title":"Compare the offers"},{"brief":"Connect the chosen offer to a fictional contract brief. This exercise is a document handoff, not legal advice.","campaignId":"coupa-source-to-pay","fields":[{"expected":"12 kits with cases","explanation":"Cases alone would remove the electronics kits from the handoff. Retain both kits and cases from the chosen offer.","id":"scope","label":"Contract scope","options":[{"label":"12 kits with cases","value":"12 kits with cases"},{"label":"12 cases only","value":"12 cases only"}]},{"expected":"30 days after invoice date","explanation":"Immediate payment on order changes the agreed obligation. Carry forward the parties’ 30-days-after-invoice term without inventing a new one.","id":"paymentTerm","label":"Payment term","options":[{"label":"30 days after invoice date","value":"30 days after invoice date"},{"label":"Pay immediately on order","value":"Pay immediately on order"}]}],"fixtureRevision":"1","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-source-to-pay-03-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-source-to-pay-03","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"award","lines":["Birch: 12 electronics kits with reusable cases.","Total 570 credits; arrival 11 October."],"title":"Chosen offer"},{"id":"terms","lines":["The parties have agreed payment 30 days after invoice date.","The contract brief must retain the chosen scope and those terms."],"title":"Agreed scenario terms"}],"revision":"3","role":"Sourcing coordinator","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa glossary — Source to pay","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/coupa-glossary/overview/s"}],"success":"Contract brief prepared with the awarded scope and agreed payment term.","title":"Prepare the terms handoff"},{"brief":"A draft request is ready. Apply the fictional organization’s handoff policy; this is not a live Coupa configuration.","campaignId":"coupa-source-to-pay","fields":[{"expected":"Department approver","explanation":"570 credits exceeds this case’s 500-credit threshold. Sending the draft to the supplier would skip the required department review.","id":"nextOwner","label":"Next owner","options":[{"label":"Department approver","value":"Department approver"},{"label":"Supplier","value":"Supplier"}]},{"expected":"Pending approval","explanation":"Pending approval preserves the required review step. Calling the draft an issued order would claim an authorization that has not happened.","id":"nextState","label":"Requested next state","options":[{"label":"Pending approval","value":"Pending approval"},{"label":"Issued order","value":"Issued order"}]}],"fixtureRevision":"1","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-source-to-pay-04-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-source-to-pay-04","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"request","lines":["12 kits, total 570 credits. Status: Draft.","Supplier and contract references are present."],"title":"Request R-104"},{"id":"policy","lines":["A department approver reviews requests above 500 credits.","Only an approved request can proceed to the buyer for order issuance."],"title":"Scenario policy"}],"revision":"3","role":"Requester","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa glossary — Approval","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/coupa-glossary/overview/a"},{"title":"Coupa Core API — Requisitions","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/developer-documentation/the-coupa-core-api/resources/transactional-resources/requisitions-api-requisitions"}],"success":"Request R-104 routed for approval; no purchase order has been issued.","title":"Route the request"},{"brief":"Update the fictional receiving record using the delivery evidence. Leave undelivered quantities outstanding.","campaignId":"coupa-source-to-pay","fields":[{"expected":"PO-204 / line 1","explanation":"PO-204 is the order on the delivery evidence. Posting to PO-999 would leave the real order outstanding and corrupt an unrelated record.","id":"line","label":"Order line","options":[{"label":"PO-204 / line 1","value":"PO-204 / line 1"},{"label":"PO-999 / line 1","value":"PO-999 / line 1"}]},{"expected":"8","explanation":"Recording 12 would claim the four undelivered kits arrived and hide the remaining delivery. Record the eight physically received today.","id":"received","label":"Quantity received today","options":[{"label":"8","value":"8"},{"label":"12","value":"12"}]}],"fixtureRevision":"1","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-source-to-pay-05-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-source-to-pay-05","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"order","lines":["Line 1: 12 electronics kits. Previously received: 0."],"title":"Order PO-204"},{"id":"delivery","lines":["8 kits arrived intact today.","The remaining 4 kits are scheduled for later."],"title":"Delivery note D-204A"}],"revision":"3","role":"Receiver","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa Core API — Receipts","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/developer-documentation/the-coupa-core-api/resources/transactional-resources/receipts-api"}],"success":"Receipt recorded for 8 kits. Four kits remain outstanding.","title":"Record what arrived"},{"brief":"Reconcile the example’s three-document check and prepare the correct handoff. A later payment is a separate event.","campaignId":"coupa-source-to-pay","fields":[{"expected":"Documents match","explanation":"The order, receipts and invoice each show 12 kits, and the invoice matches 570 credits. Flagging a quantity mismatch would delay this ready handoff.","id":"match","label":"Reconciliation result","options":[{"label":"Documents match","value":"Documents match"},{"label":"Quantity mismatch","value":"Quantity mismatch"}]},{"expected":"Approved for payment","explanation":"This case permits approval after the matching check, but no payment record exists. Marking it paid would conceal the outstanding payment step.","id":"state","label":"After the review","options":[{"label":"Approved for payment","value":"Approved for payment"},{"label":"Paid","value":"Paid"}]}],"fixtureRevision":"2","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-source-to-pay-06-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-source-to-pay-06","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"chain","lines":["PO-204 ordered 12 kits. Receipts now total 12 kits.","Invoice INV-204 is for 12 kits at the agreed 570 credits."],"title":"Order and receipt"},{"id":"status","lines":["Status: Pending approval. No payment record exists.","The scenario requires an AP review before payment scheduling.","For this simplified case, matching quantities and the agreed total satisfy that review; there are no other holds. Real review rules vary by organization."],"title":"Current invoice"}],"revision":"3","role":"Accounts payable","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa Supplier Portal — View and manage invoices","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/supplier-documentation/coupa-for-suppliers/the-coupa-supplier-portal-or-csp/features-and-processes-in-